// Merchant acquiring (acquiring-service): payment links and point-of-sale payment requests for the businesses that
// bank with Forge. Card details never reach Forge: the payer pays on the acquiring bank's hosted checkout, and the
// acquirer reports each result to a signed webhook. Card takings settle to the merchant's account the next day, less
// the merchant discount rate. Gated by pkg/licence (acquiring): production refuses it until an acquiring bank, the
// card schemes and PCI DSS scope are in place, and refuses the simulator always.

